  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute, until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the chopped sauerkraut, paprika, salt, and pepper.",
    "Cook for 2-3 minutes, until the sauerkraut has slightly caramelized.",
    "Crack in the eggs and scramble them with the sauerkraut mixture.",
    "Cook for another 2-3 minutes, until the eggs are cooked through.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve hot."
